Z||000012||Tom88gt||01-10-2000||02:46 PM||||TOM, since Turbo86SE has already sent you some parts to mold, I'll just wait until I hear from you, if they don't work out or you need something else.<P>Carrolles, have the junk yard cut the top off, about half way down the windshield pillars and same spot for the rear.  Remove the entire door/top weather stripping first and aluminum channels (ft & rr) too.  If it looks unique to the t-tops, take it.  I'm getting my entire roof, (t-tops & all for $200 - but no headliner/light).||||reg||6
